I know this is a bit further down the line, but right now the smartfm words
are learned in alphabetical order. What about making the order sync up with
the order they're introduced in Lojban For Beginners (or whatever
lojban-learning text people vote for)? This would make smart.fm a much more
useful tool for people learning lojban from the chosen text.
Not as important for people who already know all/most of the lojban
vocabulary, but really important for beginners.

-Geoff

